            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahithofeli yaamwiramu ati: “Ja obe ni baka lata wo ab'embali mu buliri, be yaleka okukuuma ekisaagaati eky'obwakyabazinga. Olwo Abaisiraeli boonaboona bwe banaakiwulira, baidha kukitegeera bati ofuuse muzigu eri lata wo. Ekyo kireetere abantu abali n'iwe okweyongeramu amaani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale baasimbira Abusalomu eweema ghaigulu ku ngulu kw'endhu ya kyabazinga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16:22",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "... Ku ngulu kw'endhu ...:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Obusulya obw'endhu tibwabangaku migongo. Kale ng'omuntu asobola okulambaalaku obukalamu. Balam 3:20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " yaaja yaaba ni baka lata we ab'embali mu buliri, ng'Abaisiraeli boonaboona babona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
